{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793818153627922002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"weakwilled-catchable-cattle","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"8c7355bc1d13b326f2881ef8243f755c57c14a256793a21c7b5de9b39820095e","event_uuid":"49365edf-cada-4571-a559-cb1944ac9b95","position":{"commit_sha":"cce50379581e39df1384fe7a66a9554fbd535246","position":"1793818073429425001-49365edf-cada-4571-a559-cb1944ac9b95"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"79ea52344622fea3068aedbc4a4b3dccecd74899d2b73defdeaa0b428db47f6b","event_uuid":"55fdc3da-0afb-46fc-b993-26baa612f2be","position":{"commit_sha":"0be8714f75ef0ba44b643f15147c1a4fec41117a","position":"1793818153627922001-55fdc3da-0afb-46fc-b993-26baa612f2be"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793818073429425001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"55fdc3da-0afb-46fc-b993-26baa612f2be","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"40c3-d22a-3872-4c8c"}],"description":"## Observation\n`tests/interfaces/store/test_workflow_entrypoints.py::test_mcp_run_workflow_is_async_and_pollable` polls `get_workflow_status` 50 times with `time.sleep(0.1)` between polls (lines 134-143). That gives the background `run_workflow` a fixed 5-second wall-clock window to settle, and the test then fails with \"background run never settled\" (line 144).\n\nMeasured on a macOS dev host, 2026-11-04 PST:\n- It failed once in a 4-worker targeted run while `make lint` and `make typecheck` were also running.\n- It failed once more in isolation, minutes later, with other sessions active on the host.\n- It then passed 26 of 26 runs on unmodified `origin/main` (`e0bfa4e5154`), and 30 of 30 further runs with the synonymous-destined-cricket change. 16 runs of each arm were 4-way concurrent.\n\nSo the failure tracks host load, not a code difference. A fixed wall-clock deadline on a background thread's completion is the class of flake AGENTS.md says to root-cause rather than retry.\n\nDiscovered while verifying synonymous-destined-cricket (40c3-d22a-3872-4c8c).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The test waits on the run's own completion signal or a state change, not a fixed 5-second wall clock, and still fails when the run never settles.\n- [ ] The test passes 20 of 20 runs under 4-way concurrent load.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"8797-4707-a264-4ffc","ticket_type":"bug","title":"MCP run_workflow pollable test gives the background run a fixed 5 s wall clock","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["49365edf-cada-4571-a559-cb1944ac9b95","55fdc3da-0afb-46fc-b993-26baa612f2be"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793818153627922002,"uuid":"37598587-f7f9-400f-bc81-d9de36e7cac0"}